sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer
    participant Web as Vue + Inertia
    participant TPC as TicketPurchaseController
    participant PS as PaystackService
    participant PSK as Paystack
    participant PC as PaymentController
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Q as Queue and mail
    actor Staff
    participant TC as TicketController

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Buyer,DB: F1 Purchase and pricing
    Buyer->>Web: choose tickets, enter discount code
    Web->>TPC: POST purchase
    TPC->>DB: lock ticket types, check availability
    TPC->>DB: validate discount, compute total
    TPC->>DB: create Order (pending) and Tickets (pending)
    TPC->>PS: initialise transaction
    PS->>PSK: POST transaction/initialize
    PSK-->>PS: authorization_url, reference
    TPC-->>Web: redirect to Paystack
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Buyer,Q: F2 Payment confirmation (two paths, one outcome)
    Buyer->>PSK: pay
    par Browser callback
        PSK-->>Buyer: redirect to callback
        Buyer->>PC: GET callback?reference
        PC->>PS: verify transaction
        PS->>PSK: GET transaction/verify
    and Webhook
        PSK->>PC: POST webhook (x-paystack-signature)
        PC->>PC: verify HMAC signature
    end
    PC->>DB: lock order, skip if already paid
    PC->>DB: mark Order paid, Tickets active, create Payment
    PC->>Q: send ticket email
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
    Note over Staff,DB: F3 Ticket validation and entry
    Staff->>TC: scan QR
    TC->>DB: find ticket, check status
    alt valid and unused
        TC->>DB: mark ticket used
        TC-->>Staff: admit
    else used, pending or cancelled
        TC-->>Staff: reject
    end
    end
